{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rentlord</strong> is a roguelike real estate management game where you build and expand your own property portfolio while overcoming challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/CollectRent.gif?t=1744883167\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore The Market!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Browse a variety of properties available for purchase, each with unique benefits and strategic potential to expand your real estate empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/ExploreMarket.png?t=1744883167\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Power Up with Plugins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Browse a variety of powerful plugins in the shop, each designed to enhance your strategy and maximize your income. Choose the ones that best suit your playstyle and expand your real estate empire with unique advantages and boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/Plugins.png?t=1744883167\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Your Rent!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See your strategic decisions pay off as you collect rent from your properties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/CollectRent.gif?t=1744883167\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546440?t=1744883167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/db96550151f9143ca400f43016968fc4ca52be5e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744883167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/f7a799d82248