 off as you collect rent from your properties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/CollectRent.gif?t=1744883167\" /></p>","developers":["verty"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/d3df8ae2fb5064cb17154985581e4f0a486b3541/header.jpg?t=1744883167","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - verty, Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Japan) by Gamersky Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS (Proton-8 Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8 or higher, ATI X1600 or higher, or Intel HD 3000 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton-8 Recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1 (M2 and M3) or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1280x720 minimum resolution, OpenGL 2.0 Support, and recommended dedicated graphics card with 128 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> M1, M2, M3 Silicon Mac &amp; ARM Supported<